<!doctype html>
<html lang="id">
<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8"/>

<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>

<title>Mengalihkan ke Composer…</title>

<meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0; url=/studio/compose"/>

<style>
:root{
--bg:#F7F4EE;
--text:#201D19;
--muted:#6B645A;
--accent:#7A2635;
}

*{
box-sizing:border-box;
}

body{
margin:0;
min-height:100vh;
display:flex;
align-items:center;
justify-content:center;
background:var(--bg);
color:var(--text);
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
}

.card{
background:white;
border:1px solid #DED6CA;
border-radius:28px;
padding:42px;
max-width:480px;
text-align:center;
}

.eyebrow{
margin:0 0 12px;
font-size:13px;
letter-spacing:.08em;
text-transform:uppercase;
color:var(--muted);
}

h1{
margin:0 0 18px;
font-family:Georgia,serif;
font-weight:400;
font-size:42px;
}

p{
margin:0;
line-height:1.8;
color:#514C45;
}

.loader{
width:54px;
height:54px;
margin:28px auto;
border-radius:50%;
border:4px solid #E9E1D6;
border-top-color:var(--accent);
animation:spin .9s linear infinite;
}

a{
display:inline-block;
margin-top:22px;
padding:12px 18px;
border-radius:12px;
background:var(--accent);
color:white;
text-decoration:none;
}

@keyframes spin{
to{
transform:rotate(360deg);
}
}
</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="card">

<p class="eyebrow">
RAKAN Studio
</p>

<h1>Composer</h1>

<p>
Semua artikel baru sekarang dimulai dari Composer. Anda akan diarahkan secara otomatis.
</p>

<div class="loader"></div>

<a href="/studio/compose">
Buka Composer
</a>

</div>

<script>
location.replace("/studio/compose");
</script>

</body>
</html>